---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GenerateReachForecastCustomersRequest
---@field currencyCode? string The currency code. Three-character ISO 4217 currency code.
---@field reachApplicationInfo? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdditionalApplicationInfo Optional. Additional information on the application issuing the request.
---@field customerReachGroup? string The name of the customer being planned for. This is a user-defined value.
