---@field customerInsightsGroup? string Optional. The name of the customer being planned for. This is a user-defined value.
---@field audienceDefinition? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceDefinition Provide a seed audience to get suggestions for.
---@field customerId string Required. The ID of the customer.

