---@field countryCode? string Required. Two-letter country code of the phone number. Examples: 'US', 'us'.
---@field phoneNumber? string Required. The advertiser's raw phone number. Examples: '1234567890', '(123)456-7890'

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__CallAssetCallConversionReportingStateEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"DISABLED"|"USE_ACCOUNT_LEVEL_CALL_CONVERSION_ACTION"|"USE_RESOURCE_LEVEL_CALL_CONVERSION_ACTION"

