---A Demand Gen Carousel Card asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__DemandGenCarouselCardAsset
---@field squareMarketingImageAsset? string Asset resource name of the associated square marketing image. This and/or a marketing image asset is required.
---@field marketingImageAsset? string Asset resource name of the associated 1.91:1 marketing image. This and/or square marketing image asset is required.
---@field headline? string Required. Headline of the carousel card.
---@field callToActionText? string Call to action text.
---@field portraitMarketingImageAsset? string Asset resource name of the associated 4:5 portrait marketing image.

---A Demand Gen multi asset ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__DemandGenMultiAssetAdInfo
---@field squareMarketingImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList Square marketing image assets to be used in the ad. Valid image types are GIF, JPEG, and PNG. The minimum size is 300x300 and the aspect ratio must be 1:1 (+-1%). Required if marketing_images is not present.
---@field logoImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList Logo image assets to be used in the ad. Valid image types are GIF, JPEG, and PNG. The minimum size is 128x128 and the aspect ratio must be 1:1 (+-1%). At least 1 and max 5 logo images can be specified.
---@field businessName? string The Advertiser/brand name. Maximum display width is 25. Required.
---@field tallPortraitMarketingImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList Tall portrait marketing image assets to be used in the ad. Valid image types are GIF, JPEG, and PNG. The minimum size is 600x1067 and the aspect ratio must be 9:16 (+-1%). Combined with `marketing_images`, `square_marketing_images`, and `portrait_marketing_images`, the maximum is 20.
---@field portraitMarketingImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList Portrait marketing image assets to be used in the ad. Valid image types are GIF, JPEG, and PNG. The minimum size is 480x600 and the aspect ratio must be 4:5 (+-1%).
---@field callToActionText? string Call to action text.
---@field marketingImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList Marketing image assets to be used in the ad. Valid image types are GIF, JPEG, and PNG. The minimum size is 600x314 and the aspect ratio must be 1.91:1 (+-1%). Required if square_marketing_images is not present.
---@field descriptions? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList The descriptive text of the ad. Maximum display width is 90. At least 1 and max 5 descriptions can be specified.
---@field headlines? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList Headline text asset of the ad. Maximum display width is 30. At least 1 and max 5 headlines can be specified.

