---Advertiser defined events and their attributes. All the values in the nested fields are required.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__EventAttribute
---@field itemAttribute? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__EventItemAttributeList Required. Item attributes of the event.
---@field eventDateTime? string Required. Timestamp at which the event happened. The format is YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS[+/-HH:MM], where [+/-HH:MM] is an optional timezone offset from UTC. If the offset is absent, the API will use the account's timezone as default.
---@field event? string Required. Advertiser defined event to be used for remarketing. The accepted values are "Viewed", "Cart", "Purchased" and "Recommended".

