---@field postSubmitCallToActionType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LeadFormAssetPostSubmitCallToActionTypeEnum|string Pre-defined display text that encourages user action after the form is submitted.
---@field desiredIntent? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LeadFormAssetDesiredIntentEnum|string Chosen intent for the lead form, for example, more volume or more qualified.
---@field fields? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LeadFormFieldList Ordered list of input fields. This field can be updated by reordering questions, but not by adding or removing questions.
---@field callToActionDescription? string Required. Text giving a clear value proposition of what users expect once they expand the form.
---@field postSubmitDescription? string Detailed description shown after form submission that describes how the advertiser will follow up with the user.

