---@field headline? string The headline of the ad.
---@field appId? string The ID of the mobile app.
---@field description1? string The first description line of the ad.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LegacyAppInstallAdInfoAppStoreEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"APPLE_APP_STORE"|"GOOGLE_PLAY"|"WINDOWS_STORE"|"WINDOWS_PHONE_STORE"|"CN_APP_STORE"

---A legacy responsive display ad. Ads of this type are labeled 'Responsive ads' in the Google Ads UI.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LegacyResponsiveDisplayAdInfo
---@field pricePrefix? string Prefix before price. For example, 'as low as'.
---@field formatSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LegacyResponsiveDisplayAdInfoFormatSettingEnum|string Specifies which format the ad will be served in. Default is ALL_FORMATS.
---@field mainColor? string The main color of the ad in hexadecimal, for example, #ffffff for white. If one of `main_color` and `accent_color` is set, the other is required as well.
---@field accentColor? string The accent color of the ad in hexadecimal, for example, #ffffff for white. If one of `main_color` and `accent_color` is set, the other is required as well.
---@field shortHeadline? string The short version of the ad's headline.
---@field longHeadline? string The long version of the ad's headline.
---@field allowFlexibleColor? boolean Advertiser's consent to allow flexible color. When true, the ad may be served with different color if necessary. When false, the ad will be served with the specified colors or a neutral color. The default value is `true`. Must be true if `main_color` and `accent_color` are not set.
---@field callToActionText? string The call-to-action text for the ad.
---@field squareMarketingImage? string The MediaFile resource name of the square marketing image used in the ad.
---@field promoText? string Promotion text used for dynamic formats of responsive ads. For example 'Free two-day shipping'.
---@field description? string The description of the ad.
---@field marketingImage? string The MediaFile resource name of the marketing image used in the ad.
---@field businessName? string The business name in the ad.
---@field squareLogoImage? string The MediaFile resource name of the square logo image used in the ad.
---@field logoImage? string The MediaFile resource name of the logo image used in the ad.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LegacyResponsiveDisplayAdInfoFormatSettingEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"ALL_FORMATS"|"NON_NATIVE"|"NATIVE"

