---A local ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LocalAdInfo
---@field videos? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdVideoAssetList List of YouTube video assets that may be displayed with the ad. At least 1 and at most 20 video assets must be specified.
---@field path2? string Second part of optional text that can be appended to the URL in the ad. This field can only be set when `path1` is also set.
---@field callToActions? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList List of text assets for call-to-actions. When the ad serves the call-to-actions will be selected from this list. At least 1 and at most 5 call-to-actions must be specified.
---@field path1? string First part of optional text that can be appended to the URL in the ad.
---@field logoImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList List of logo image assets that may be displayed with the ad. The images must be 128x128 pixels and not larger than 120KB. At least 1 and at most 5 image assets must be specified.
---@field headlines? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList List of text assets for headlines. When the ad serves the headlines will be selected from this list. At least 1 and at most 5 headlines must be specified.
---@field marketingImages? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdImageAssetList List of marketing image assets that may be displayed with the ad. The images must be 314x600 pixels or 320x320 pixels. At least 1 and at most 20 image assets must be specified.
---@field descriptions? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList List of text assets for descriptions. When the ad serves the descriptions will be selected from this list. At least 1 and at most 5 descriptions must be specified.

