---@field placeId? string Place IDs uniquely identify a place in the Google Places database and on Google Maps. This field is unique for a given customer ID and asset type. See https://developers.google.com/places/web-service/place-id to learn more about Place ID.
---@field businessProfileLocations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__BusinessProfileLocationList The list of business locations for the customer. This will only be returned if the Location Asset is syncing from the Business Profile account. It is possible to have multiple Business Profile listings under the same account that point to the same Place ID.
