---@field state? string State code of the address. Only accepted for Store Sales.
---@field hashedFirstName? string First name of the user, which is hashed as SHA-256 after normalized (Lowercase all characters; Remove any extra spaces before, after, and in between).
---@field postalCode? string Postal code of the user's address.

