---A Promotion asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionAsset
---@field promotionCode? string A code the user should use in order to be eligible for the promotion.
---@field adScheduleTargets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdScheduleInfoList List of non-overlapping schedules specifying all time intervals for which the asset may serve. There can be a maximum of 6 schedules per day, 42 in total.
---@field termsAndConditionsUri? string URI to the terms and conditions of the promotion.
---@field promotionTarget? string Required. A freeform description of what the promotion is targeting.
---@field promotionBarcodeInfo? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionBarcodeInfo Barcode info used to generate promotion barcode for user to be eligible for the promotion.
---@field languageCode? string The language of the promotion. Represented as BCP 47 language tag.
---@field percentOff? string Percentage off discount in the promotion. 1,000,000 = 100%. Either this or money_amount_off is required.
---@field endDate? string Last date of when this asset is effective and still serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field redemptionStartDate? string Start date of when the promotion is eligible to be redeemed, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field ordersOverAmount? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__Money The amount the total order needs to be for the user to be eligible for the promotion.
---@field termsAndConditionsText? string Terms and conditions of the promotion.
---@field occasion? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionAssetOccasionEnum|string The occasion the promotion was intended for. If an occasion is set, the redemption window will need to fall within the date range associated with the occasion.
---@field redemptionEndDate? string Last date of when the promotion is eligible to be redeemed, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field discountModifier? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionAssetDiscountModifierEnum|string A modifier for qualification of the discount.
---@field promotionQrCodeInfo? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionQrCodeInfo QR code info used to generate promotion QR code for user to be eligible for the promotion.
---@field startDate? string Start date of when this asset is effective and can begin serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field moneyAmountOff? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__Money Money amount off for discount in the promotion. Either this or percent_off is required.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionAssetDiscountModifierEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"UP_TO"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PromotionAssetOccasionEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"NEW_YEARS"|"CHINESE_NEW_YEAR"|"VALENTINES_DAY"|"EASTER"|"MOTHERS_DAY"|"FATHERS_DAY"|"LABOR_DAY"|"BACK_TO_SCHOOL"|"HALLOWEEN"|"BLACK_FRIDAY"|"CYBER_MONDAY"|"CHRISTMAS"|"BOXING_DAY"|"INDEPENDENCE_DAY"|"NATIONAL_DAY"|"END_OF_SEASON"|"WINTER_SALE"|"SUMMER_SALE"|"FALL_SALE"|"SPRING_SALE"|"RAMADAN"|"EID_AL_FITR"|"EID_AL_ADHA"|"SINGLES_DAY"|"WOMENS_DAY"|"HOLI"|"PARENTS_DAY"|"ST_NICHOLAS_DAY"|"CARNIVAL"|"EPIPHANY"|"ROSH_HASHANAH"|"PASSOVER"|"HANUKKAH"|"DIWALI"|"NAVRATRI"|"SONGKRAN"|"YEAR_END_GIFT"

