---A Shopping Comparison Listing ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ShoppingComparisonListingAdInfo
---@field headline? string Headline of the ad. This field is required. Allowed length is between 25 and 45 characters.

---The shopping loyalty related data. Shopping utilizes this data to provide users with a better experience. Accessible only to merchants on the allow-list.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ShoppingLoyalty
---@field loyaltyTier? string The membership tier. It is a free-form string as each merchant may have their own loyalty system. For example, it could be a number from 1 to 10, or a string such as "Golden" or "Silver", or even empty string "".

---A standard Shopping ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ShoppingProductAdInfo

---A Smart Shopping ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ShoppingSmartAdInfo

---SimilarUserList is a list of users which are similar to users from another UserList. These lists are read-only and automatically created by Google.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SimilarUserListInfo
---@field seedUserList? string Seed UserList from which this list is derived.

---A Sitelink asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SitelinkAsset
---@field linkText? string Required. URL display text for the sitelink. The length of this string should be between 1 and 25, inclusive.
---@field description2? string Second line of the description for the sitelink. If set, the length should be between 1 and 35, inclusive, and description1 must also be set.
---@field adScheduleTargets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdScheduleInfoList List of non-overlapping schedules specifying all time intervals for which the asset may serve. There can be a maximum of 6 schedules per day, 42 in total.
---@field endDate? string Last date of when this asset is effective and still serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field startDate? string Start date of when this asset is effective and can begin serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field description1? string First line of the description for the sitelink. If set, the length should be between 1 and 35, inclusive, and description2 must also be set.

---Represents a sitelink.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SitelinkFeedItem
---@field finalUrls? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList A list of possible final URLs after all cross domain redirects.
---@field line1? string First line of the description for the sitelink. If this value is set, line2 must also be set. The length of this string should be between 0 and 35, inclusive.
---@field line2? string Second line of the description for the sitelink. If this value is set, line1 must also be set. The length of this string should be between 0 and 35, inclusive.
---@field trackingUrlTemplate? string URL template for constructing a tracking URL.
---@field linkText? string URL display text for the sitelink. The length of this string should be between 1 and 25, inclusive.
---@field finalMobileUrls? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList A list of possible final mobile URLs after all cross domain redirects.
---@field finalUrlSuffix? string Final URL suffix to be appended to landing page URLs served with parallel tracking.
---@field urlCustomParameters? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__CustomParameterList A list of mappings to be used for substituting URL custom parameter tags in the tracking_url_template, final_urls, and/or final_mobile_urls.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SitelinkFeedItemList gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SitelinkFeedItem[]

---A Smart campaign ad.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SmartCampaignAdInfo
---@field descriptions? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList List of text assets, each of which corresponds to a description when the ad serves. This list consists of a minimum of 2 and up to 4 text assets.
---@field headlines? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdTextAssetList List of text assets, each of which corresponds to a headline when the ad serves. This list consists of a minimum of 3 and up to 15 text assets.

---Store attributes of the transaction.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StoreAttribute
---@field storeCode? string Store code from https://support.google.com/business/answer/3370250#storecode

---Metadata for Store Sales Direct.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StoreSalesMetadata
---@field customKey? string Name of the store sales custom variable key. A predefined key that can be applied to the transaction and then later used for custom segmentation in reporting. Accessible only to customers on the allow-list.
---@field loyaltyFraction? number This is the fraction of all transactions that are identifiable (for example, associated with any form of customer information). Required. The fraction needs to be between 0 and 1 (excluding 0).
---@field thirdPartyMetadata? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StoreSalesThirdPartyMetadata Metadata for a third party Store Sales upload.
---@field transactionUploadFraction? number This is the ratio of sales being uploaded compared to the overall sales that can be associated with a customer. Required. The fraction needs to be between 0 and 1 (excluding 0). For example, if you upload half the sales that you are able to associate with a customer, this would be 0.5.

---Metadata for a third party Store Sales. This product is only for customers on the allow-list. Contact your Google business development representative for details on the upload configuration.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StoreSalesThirdPartyMetadata
---@field partnerMatchFraction? number The fraction of valid transactions that are matched to a third party assigned user ID on the partner side. Required. The fraction needs to be between 0 and 1 (excluding 0).
---@field validTransactionFraction? number The fraction of transactions that are valid. Invalid transactions may include invalid formats or values. Required. The fraction needs to be between 0 and 1 (excluding 0).
---@field partnerUploadFraction? number The fraction of valid transactions that are uploaded by the partner to Google. Required. The fraction needs to be between 0 and 1 (excluding 0).
---@field advertiserUploadDateTime? string Time the advertiser uploaded the data to the partner. Required. The format is "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS". Examples: "2018-03-05 09:15:00" or "2018-02-01 14:34:30"
---@field bridgeMapVersionId? string Version of partner IDs to be used for uploads. Required.
---@field partnerId? string ID of the third party partner updating the transaction feed.

---A Structured Snippet asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StructuredSnippetAsset
---@field header? string Required. The header of the snippet. This string should be one of the predefined values at https://developers.google.com/google-ads/api/reference/data/structured-snippet-headers
---@field values? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList Required. The values in the snippet. The size of this collection should be between 3 and 10, inclusive. The length of each value should be between 1 and 25 characters, inclusive.

---Represents an attestation about synthetic content from a single source.
