---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SyntheticContentAttestationStatusEnum|string Indicates whether the content is considered synthetic by this source.
---@field source? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SyntheticContentAttestationSourceEnum|string The source of the synthetic content attestation.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SyntheticContentAttestationSourceEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"ADVERTISER_ATTESTED"|"GOOGLE_GENERATED_ADVERTISER_REVIEWED"|"GOOGLE_GENERATED_FULLY_AUTOMATED"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SyntheticContentAttestationStatusEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"NOT_SYNTHETIC"|"IS_SYNTHETIC"

