---An automated bid strategy that sets bids to help get as many conversions as possible at the target cost-per-acquisition (CPA) you set.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpa
---@field cpcBidFloorMicros? string Minimum bid limit that can be set by the bid strategy. The limit applies to all keywords managed by the strategy. This should only be set for portfolio bid strategies.
---@field cpcBidCeilingMicros? string Maximum bid limit that can be set by the bid strategy. The limit applies to all keywords managed by the strategy. This should only be set for portfolio bid strategies.
---@field targetCpaMicros? string Average CPA target. This target should be greater than or equal to minimum billable unit based on the currency for the account.

---Projected metrics for a specific target CPA amount.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpaSimulationPoint
---@field topSlotImpressions? string Projected number of top slot impressions. Only search advertising channel type supports this field.
---@field inAppActions? number Projected number of in-app actions.
---@field impressions? string Projected number of impressions.
---@field targetCpaScalingModifier? number The simulated scaling modifier upon which projected metrics are based. All CPA targets relevant to the simulated entity are scaled by this modifier.
---@field interactions? string Projected number of interactions. Only discovery advertising channel type supports this field.
---@field biddableConversionsValue? number Projected total value of biddable conversions.
---@field clicks? string Projected number of clicks.
---@field appInstalls? number Projected number of app installs.
---@field biddableConversions? number Projected number of biddable conversions.
---@field costMicros? string Projected cost in micros.
---@field targetCpaMicros? string The simulated target CPA upon which projected metrics are based.
---@field requiredBudgetAmountMicros? string Projected required daily budget that the advertiser must set in order to receive the estimated traffic, in micros of advertiser currency.

---A container for simulation points for simulations of type TARGET_CPA.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpaSimulationPointList
---@field points? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpaSimulationPointList_ Projected metrics for a series of target CPA amounts.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpaSimulationPointList_ gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpaSimulationPoint[]

---An automated bidding strategy that sets bids to help get as many clicks as possible at the target cost-per-click (CPC) you set.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpc
---@field targetCpcMicros? string Average CPC target. This target should be greater than or equal to minimum billable unit based on the currency for the account.

---Target CPM (cost per thousand impressions) is an automated bidding strategy that sets bids to optimize performance given the target CPM you set.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetCpm

---An automated bidding strategy that sets bids so that a certain percentage of search ads are shown at the top of the first page (or other targeted location).
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShare
---@field locationFractionMicros? string The chosen fraction of ads to be shown in the targeted location in micros. For example, 1% equals 10,000.
---@field cpcBidCeilingMicros? string The highest CPC bid the automated bidding system is permitted to specify. This is a required field entered by the advertiser that sets the ceiling and specified in local micros.
---@field location? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareLocationEnum|string The targeted location on the search results page.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareLocationEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"ANYWHERE_ON_PAGE"|"TOP_OF_PAGE"|"ABSOLUTE_TOP_OF_PAGE"

---Projected metrics for a specific target impression share value.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareSimulationPoint
---@field biddableConversionsValue? number Projected total value of biddable conversions.
---@field requiredCpcBidCeilingMicros? string Projected required daily cpc bid ceiling that the advertiser must set to realize this simulation, in micros of the advertiser currency.
---@field requiredBudgetAmountMicros? string Projected required daily budget that the advertiser must set in order to receive the estimated traffic, in micros of advertiser currency.
---@field clicks? string Projected number of clicks.
---@field impressions? string Projected number of impressions.
---@field absoluteTopImpressions? string Projected number of absolute top impressions. Only search advertising channel type supports this field.
---@field biddableConversions? number Projected number of biddable conversions.
---@field costMicros? string Projected cost in micros.
---@field topSlotImpressions? string Projected number of top slot impressions. Only search advertising channel type supports this field.
---@field targetImpressionShareMicros? string The simulated target impression share value (in micros) upon which projected metrics are based. For example, 10% impression share, which is equal to 0.1, is stored as 100_000. This value is validated and will not exceed 1M (100%).

---A container for simulation points for simulations of type TARGET_IMPRESSION_SHARE.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareSimulationPointList
---@field points? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareSimulationPointList_ Projected metrics for a specific target impression share value.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareSimulationPointList_ gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetImpressionShareSimulationPoint[]

---The list of per-targeting-dimension targeting settings.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetRestriction
---@field targetingDimension? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetRestrictionTargetingDimensionEnum|string The targeting dimension that these settings apply to.
---@field bidOnly? boolean Indicates whether to restrict your ads to show only for the criteria you have selected for this targeting_dimension, or to target all values for this targeting_dimension and show ads based on your targeting in other TargetingDimensions. A value of `true` means that these criteria will only apply bid modifiers, and not affect targeting. A value of `false` means that these criteria will restrict targeting as well as applying bid modifiers.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetRestrictionList gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TargetRestriction[]

