---Contains third party measurement partner related data for video campaigns.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ThirdPartyIntegrationPartnerData
---@field clientId? string The client ID that allows the measurement partner to join multiple campaigns for a particular advertiser.
---@field thirdPartyPlacementId? string The third party placement ID that maps the measurement partner data with a campaign (or a group of related campaigns) specific data.

---A topic criterion. Use topics to target or exclude placements in the Google Display Network based on the category into which the placement falls (for example, "Pets & Animals/Pets/Dogs").
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TopicInfo
---@field topicConstant? string The Topic Constant resource name.
---@field path? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList The category to target or exclude. Each subsequent element in the array describes a more specific sub-category. For example, "Pets & Animals", "Pets", "Dogs" represents the "Pets & Animals/Pets/Dogs" category.

---Attribute of the store sales transaction.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TransactionAttribute
---@field transactionDateTime? string Timestamp when transaction occurred. Required. The format is "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS[+/-HH:MM]", where [+/-HH:MM] is an optional timezone offset from UTC. If the offset is absent, the API will use the account's timezone as default. Examples: "2018-03-05 09:15:00" or "2018-02-01 14:34:30+03:00"
---@field orderId? string Transaction order id. Useful to group transactions which are part of the same order.
---@field storeAttribute? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__StoreAttribute Store attributes of the transaction.
---@field transactionAmountMicros? number Transaction amount in micros. Required. Transaction amount in micros needs to be greater than 1000. If item Attributes are provided, it represents the total value of the items, after multiplying the unit price per item by the quantity provided in the ItemAttributes.
---@field conversionAction? string The resource name of conversion action to report conversions to. Required.
---@field currencyCode? string Transaction currency code. ISO 4217 three-letter code is used. Required.
---@field customValue? string Value of the custom variable for each transaction. Allowed only if a custom key is provided in the store sales metadata.
---@field itemAttribute? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ItemAttribute Item attributes of the transaction. Accessible only to customers on the allow-list.

