---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__TravelAdInfo

---A unified call asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedCallAsset
---@field callTrackingEnabled? boolean Whether the call should be enabled on call tracking. Applies to Microsoft Ads.
---@field callConversionReportingState? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedCallAssetCallConversionReportingStateEnum|string Output only. Indicates whether this CallAsset should use its own call conversion setting, follow the account level setting, or disable call conversion.
---@field callConversionAction? string The conversion action to attribute a call conversion to. If not set, the default conversion action is used. This field only has effect if call_conversion_reporting_state is set to USE_RESOURCE_LEVEL_CALL_CONVERSION_ACTION.
---@field useSearcherTimeZone? boolean Whether to show the call extension in search user's time zone. Applies to Microsoft Ads.
---@field endDate? string Last date of when this asset is effective and still serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field callOnly? boolean Whether the call only shows the phone number without a link to the website. Applies to Microsoft Ads.
---@field countryCode? string Two-letter country code of the phone number. Examples: 'US', 'us'.
---@field phoneNumber? string The advertiser's raw phone number. Examples: '1234567890', '(123)456-7890'
---@field startDate? string Start date of when this asset is effective and can begin serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field adScheduleTargets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdScheduleInfoList List of non-overlapping schedules specifying all time intervals for which the asset may serve. There can be a maximum of 6 schedules per day, 42 in total.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedCallAssetCallConversionReportingStateEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"DISABLED"|"USE_ACCOUNT_LEVEL_CALL_CONVERSION_ACTION"|"USE_RESOURCE_LEVEL_CALL_CONVERSION_ACTION"

