---@field adScheduleTargets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AdScheduleInfoList List of non-overlapping schedules specifying all time intervals for which the asset may serve. There can be a maximum of 6 schedules per day, 42 in total.
---@field endDate? string Last date of when this asset is effective and still serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.
---@field useSearcherTimeZone? boolean Whether to show the asset in search user's time zone. Applies to Microsoft Ads.
---@field startDate? string Start date of when this asset is effective and can begin serving, in yyyy-MM-dd format.

---A unified location asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedLocationAsset
---@field placeId? string Place IDs uniquely identify a place in the Google Places database and on Google Maps. This field is unique for a given customer ID and asset type. See https://developers.google.com/places/web-service/place-id to learn more about Place ID.
---@field locationOwnershipType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedLocationAssetLocationOwnershipTypeEnum|string The type of location ownership. If the type is BUSINESS_OWNER, it will be served as a location extension. If the type is AFFILIATE, it will be served as an affiliate location.
---@field businessProfileLocations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__BusinessProfileLocationList The list of business locations for the customer. This will only be returned if the Location Asset is syncing from the Business Profile account. It is possible to have multiple Business Profile listings under the same account that point to the same Place ID.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UnifiedLocationAssetLocationOwnershipTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"BUSINESS_OWNER"|"AFFILIATE"

