---Represents a summarized account budget billable cost.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_Invoice_AccountBudgetSummary
---@field campaignSummaries? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_Invoice_CampaignSummaryList Output only. The list of summarized campaign level information associated with this account budget.
---@field billableActivityDateRange? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__DateRange Output only. The billable activity date range of the account budget, within the service date range of this invoice. The end date is inclusive. This can be different from the account budget's start and end time.
---@field overdeliveryAmountMicros? string Output only. The pretax overdelivery amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros (negative value).
---@field taxAmountMicros? string Output only. The tax amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros.
---@field accountBudget? string Output only. The resource name of the account budget associated with this summarized billable cost. AccountBudget resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/accountBudgets/{account_budget_id}`
---@field customerDescriptiveName? string Output only. The descriptive name of the account budget's customer. It appears on the invoice PDF as "Account".
---@field invalidActivitySummaries? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_Invoice_InvalidActivitySummaryList Output only. The list of summarized invalid activity credits with original linkages.
---@field purchaseOrderNumber? string Output only. The purchase order number of the account budget. It appears on the invoice PDF as "Purchase order".
---@field customer? string Output only. The resource name of the customer associated with this account budget. This contains the customer ID, which appears on the invoice PDF as "Account ID". Customer resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}`
---@field servedAmountMicros? string Output only. The pretax served amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros. This is only useful to reconcile invoice and delivery data.
---@field billedAmountMicros? string Output only. The pretax billed amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros. This does not account for any adjustments.
---@field accountBudgetName? string Output only. The name of the account budget. It appears on the invoice PDF as "Account budget".
---@field totalAmountMicros? string Output only. The total amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros. This equals the sum of the account budget subtotal amount and the account budget tax amount.
---@field subtotalAmountMicros? string Output only. The pretax subtotal amount attributable to this budget during the service period, in micros.
---@field invalidActivityAmountMicros? string Output only. The pretax invalid activity amount attributable to this budget in previous months, in micros (negative value).

