---An account-level budget. It contains information about the budget itself, as well as the most recently approved changes to the budget and proposed changes that are pending approval. The proposed changes that are pending approval, if any, are found in 'pending_proposal'. Effective details about the budget are found in fields prefixed 'approved_', 'adjusted_' and those without a prefix. Since some effective details may differ from what the user had originally requested (for example, spending limit), these differences are juxtaposed through 'proposed_', 'approved_', and possibly 'adjusted_' fields. This resource is mutated using AccountBudgetProposal and cannot be mutated directly. A budget may have at most one pending proposal at any given time. It is read through pending_proposal. Once approved, a budget may be subject to adjustments, such as credit adjustments. Adjustments create differences between the 'approved' and 'adjusted' fields, which would otherwise be identical.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudget
---@field proposedStartDateTime? string Output only. The proposed start time of the account-level budget in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format. If a start time type of NOW was proposed, this is the time of request.
---@field adjustedSpendingLimitMicros? string Output only. The adjusted spending limit in micros. One million is equivalent to one unit. If the approved spending limit is finite, the adjusted spending limit may vary depending on the types of adjustments applied to this budget, if applicable. The different kinds of adjustments are described here: https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/1704323 For example, a debit adjustment reduces how much the account is allowed to spend.
---@field purchaseOrderNumber? string Output only. A purchase order number is a value that helps users reference this budget in their monthly invoices.
---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the account-level budget.
---@field approvedSpendingLimitMicros? string Output only. The approved spending limit in micros. One million is equivalent to one unit. This will only be populated if the proposed spending limit is finite, and will always be greater than or equal to the proposed spending limit.
---@field billingSetup? string Output only. The resource name of the billing setup associated with this account-level budget. BillingSetup resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/billingSetups/{billing_setup_id}`
---@field proposedSpendingLimitType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposedSpendingLimitTypeEnum Output only. The proposed spending limit as a well-defined type, for example, INFINITE.
---@field proposedSpendingLimitMicros? string Output only. The proposed spending limit in micros. One million is equivalent to one unit.
---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetStatusEnum Output only. The status of this account-level budget.
---@field proposedEndTimeType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposedEndTimeTypeEnum Output only. The proposed end time as a well-defined type, for example, FOREVER.
---@field approvedSpendingLimitType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetApprovedSpendingLimitTypeEnum Output only. The approved spending limit as a well-defined type, for example, INFINITE. This will only be populated if the approved spending limit is INFINITE.
---@field notes? string Output only. Notes associated with the budget.
---@field approvedEndDateTime? string Output only. The approved end time in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format.
---@field resourceName? string Output only. The resource name of the account-level budget. AccountBudget resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/accountBudgets/{account_budget_id}`
---@field adjustedSpendingLimitType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetAdjustedSpendingLimitTypeEnum Output only. The adjusted spending limit as a well-defined type, for example, INFINITE. This will only be populated if the adjusted spending limit is INFINITE, which is guaranteed to be true if the approved spending limit is INFINITE.
---@field approvedEndTimeType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetApprovedEndTimeTypeEnum Output only. The approved end time as a well-defined type, for example, FOREVER.
---@field pendingProposal? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_AccountBudget_PendingAccountBudgetProposal Output only. The pending proposal to modify this budget, if applicable.
---@field approvedStartDateTime? string Output only. The approved start time of the account-level budget in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format. For example, if a new budget is approved after the proposed start time, the approved start time is the time of approval.
---@field amountServedMicros? string Output only. The value of Ads that have been served, in micros. This includes overdelivery costs, in which case a credit might be automatically applied to the budget (see total_adjustments_micros).
---@field proposedEndDateTime? string Output only. The proposed end time in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format.
---@field totalAdjustmentsMicros? string Output only. The total adjustments amount. An example of an adjustment is courtesy credits.
---@field name? string Output only. The name of the account-level budget.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetAdjustedSpendingLimitTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"INFINITE"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetApprovedEndTimeTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"NOW"|"FOREVER"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetApprovedSpendingLimitTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"INFINITE"

---An account-level budget proposal. All fields prefixed with 'proposed' may not necessarily be applied directly. For example, proposed spending limits may be adjusted before their application. This is true if the 'proposed' field has an 'approved' counterpart, for example, spending limits. Note that the proposal type (proposal_type) changes which fields are required and which must remain empty.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposal
---@field proposedPurchaseOrderNumber? string Immutable. A purchase order number is a value that enables the user to help them reference this budget in their monthly invoices.
---@field approvedEndTimeType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalApprovedEndTimeTypeEnum|string Output only. The approved end date time as a well-defined type, for example, FOREVER.
---@field approvedEndDateTime? string Output only. The approved end date time in yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss format.
---@field approvedSpendingLimitType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalApprovedSpendingLimitTypeEnum|string Output only. The approved spending limit as a well-defined type, for example, INFINITE.
---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the proposal.
---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalStatusEnum|string Output only. The status of this proposal. When a new proposal is created, the status defaults to PENDING.
---@field proposedEndTimeType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalProposedEndTimeTypeEnum|string Immutable. The proposed end date time as a well-defined type, for example, FOREVER.
---@field accountBudget? string Immutable. The resource name of the account-level budget associated with this proposal.
---@field approvedStartDateTime? string Output only. The approved start date time in yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss format.
---@field proposedSpendingLimitType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalProposedSpendingLimitTypeEnum|string Immutable. The proposed spending limit as a well-defined type, for example, INFINITE.
---@field proposedNotes? string Immutable. Notes associated with this budget.
---@field billingSetup? string Immutable. The resource name of the billing setup associated with this proposal.
---@field proposedName? string Immutable. The name to assign to the account-level budget.
---@field creationDateTime? string Output only. The date time when this account-level budget proposal was created, which is not the same as its approval date time, if applicable.
---@field proposedStartTimeType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalProposedStartTimeTypeEnum|string Immutable. The proposed start date time as a well-defined type, for example, NOW.
---@field proposedEndDateTime? string Immutable. The proposed end date time in yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss format.
---@field proposedStartDateTime? string Immutable. The proposed start date time in yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss format.
---@field approvalDateTime? string Output only. The date time when this account-level budget was approved, if applicable.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the proposal. AccountBudgetProposal resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/accountBudgetProposals/{account_budget_proposal_id}`
---@field proposalType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalProposalTypeEnum|string Immutable. The type of this proposal, for example, END to end the budget associated with this proposal.
---@field proposedSpendingLimitMicros? string Immutable. The proposed spending limit in micros. One million is equivalent to one unit.
---@field approvedSpendingLimitMicros? string Output only. The approved spending limit in micros. One million is equivalent to one unit.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalApprovedEndTimeTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"NOW"|"FOREVER"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalApprovedSpendingLimitTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"INFINITE"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AccountBudgetProposalProposalTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"CREATE"|"UPDATE"|"END"|"REMOVE"

