---A view on the usage of ad group ad asset combination. Now we only support AdGroupAdAssetCombinationView for Responsive Search Ads, with more ad types planned for the future.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetCombinationView
---@field resourceName? string Output only. The resource name of the ad group ad asset combination view. The combination ID is 128 bits long, where the upper 64 bits are stored in asset_combination_id_high, and the lower 64 bits are stored in asset_combination_id_low. AdGroupAd Asset Combination view resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/adGroupAdAssetCombinationViews/{AdGroupAd.ad_group_id}~{AdGroupAd.ad.ad_id}~{AssetCombination.asset_combination_id_low}~{AssetCombination.asset_combination_id_high}`
---@field servedAssets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AssetUsageList Output only. Served assets.
---@field enabled? boolean Output only. The status between the asset combination and the latest version of the ad. If true, the asset combination is linked to the latest version of the ad. If false, it means the link once existed but has been removed and is no longer present in the latest version of the ad.

---Contains policy information for an ad group ad asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetPolicySummary
---@field policyTopicEntries? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__PolicyTopicEntryList Output only. The list of policy findings for the ad group ad asset.
---@field reviewStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetPolicySummaryReviewStatusEnum Output only. Where in the review process this ad group ad asset is.
---@field approvalStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetPolicySummaryApprovalStatusEnum Output only. The overall approval status of this ad group ad asset, calculated based on the status of its individual policy topic entries.

