---@field pinnedField? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetViewPinnedFieldEnum Output only. Pinned field.
---@field source? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__AdGroupAdAssetViewSourceEnum Output only. Source of the ad group ad asset.

