---@field keyword? string Output only. The associated keyword, if one exists and the click corresponds to the SEARCH channel.
---@field gclid? string Output only. The Google Click ID.
---@field areaOfInterest? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ClickLocation Output only. The location criteria matching the area of interest associated with the impression.
