---@field userList? string Output only. The associated user list, if one exists.
---@field adGroupAd? string Output only. The associated ad.
---@field campaignLocationTarget? string Output only. The associated campaign location target, if one exists.
---@field pageNumber? string Output only. Page number in search results where the ad was shown.

