---@field googleAnalytics4Settings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_ConversionAction_GoogleAnalytics4Settings Output only. Google Analytics 4 settings for Google Analytics 4 conversion types.
---@field countingType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionCountingTypeEnum|string How to count conversion events for the conversion action.
---@field category? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionCategoryEnum|string The category of conversions reported for this conversion action.
---@field type? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionTypeEnum|string Immutable. The type of this conversion action.
---@field firebaseSettings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_ConversionAction_FirebaseSettings Output only. Firebase settings for Firebase conversion types.
---@field valueSettings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_ConversionAction_ValueSettings Settings related to the value for conversion events associated with this conversion action.
