---@field origin? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionOriginEnum|string Output only. The conversion origin of this conversion action.
---@field ownerCustomer? string Output only. The resource name of the conversion action owner customer, or null if this is a system-defined conversion action.
---@field name? string The name of the conversion action. This field is required and should not be empty when creating new conversion actions.
---@field clickThroughLookbackWindowDays? string The maximum number of days that may elapse between an interaction (for example, a click) and a conversion event.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the conversion action. Conversion action resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/conversionActions/{conversion_action_id}`
---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionStatusEnum|string The status of this conversion action for conversion event accrual.
---@field floodlightSettings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_ConversionAction_FloodlightSettings Output only. Floodlight settings for Floodlight conversion types.
---@field appId? string App ID for an app conversion action.
---@field primaryForGoal? boolean If a conversion action's primary_for_goal bit is false, the conversion action is non-biddable for all campaigns regardless of their customer conversion goal or campaign conversion goal. However, custom conversion goals do not respect primary_for_goal, so if a campaign has a custom conversion goal configured with a primary_for_goal = false conversion action, that conversion action is still biddable. By default, primary_for_goal will be true if not set. In V9, primary_for_goal can only be set to false after creation through an 'update' operation because it's not declared as optional.
---@field creationTime? string Output only. Timestamp of the Floodlight activity's creation, formatted in ISO 8601.
---@field mobileAppVendor? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionActionMobileAppVendorEnum|string Output only. Mobile app vendor for an app conversion action.
---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the conversion action.
---@field viewThroughLookbackWindowDays? string The maximum number of days which may elapse between an impression and a conversion without an interaction.
---@field thirdPartyAppAnalyticsSettings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources_ConversionAction_ThirdPartyAppAnalyticsSettings Output only. Third Party App Analytics settings for third party conversion types.

