---@field creditState? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CreditDetailsCreditStateEnum Output only. Credit state of the lead.
---@field creditStateLastUpdateDateTime? string Output only. The date time when the credit state of the lead was last updated. The format is "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS" in the Google Ads account's timezone. Examples: "2018-03-05 09:15:00" or "2018-02-01 14:34:30"

