---@field queryable? boolean Output only. True when the custom column is available to be used in the query of SearchAds360Service.Search and SearchAds360Service.SearchStream.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the custom column. Custom column resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/customColumns/{custom_column_id}`
---@field id? string Output only. ID of the custom column.
---@field referencesAttributes? boolean Output only. True when the custom column is referring to one or more attributes.
---@field name? string Output only. User-defined name of the custom column.
---@field referencesMetrics? boolean Output only. True when the custom column is referring to one or more metrics.
---@field valueType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomColumnValueTypeEnum Output only. The type of the result value of the custom column.
---@field referencedSystemColumns? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList Output only. The list of the referenced system columns of this custom column. For example, A custom column "sum of impressions and clicks" has referenced system columns of {"metrics.clicks", "metrics.impressions"}.
---@field description? string Output only. User-defined description of the custom column.

