---A customer.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__Customer
---@field optimizationScore? number Output only. Optimization score of the customer. Optimization score is an estimate of how well a customer's campaigns are set to perform. It ranges from 0% (0.0) to 100% (1.0). This field is null for all manager customers, and for unscored non-manager customers. See "About optimization score" at https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/9061546. This field is read-only.
---@field callReportingSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CallReportingSetting Call reporting setting for a customer.
---@field creationTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this customer was created. The timestamp is in the customer's time zone and in "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss" format.
---@field conversionTrackingSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__ConversionTrackingSetting Conversion tracking setting for a customer.
---@field customerAgreementSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAgreementSetting Output only. Customer Agreement Setting for a customer.
---@field managerId? string Output only. The customer ID of the manager. A 0 value indicates that the customer has no SA360 manager.
---@field hasPartnersBadge? boolean Output only. Whether the Customer has a Partners program badge. If the Customer is not associated with the Partners program, this will be false. For more information, see https://support.google.com/partners/answer/3125774.
---@field accountType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountTypeEnum|string Output only. Engine account type, for example, Google Ads, Microsoft Advertising, Yahoo Japan, Baidu, Facebook, Engine Track, etc.
---@field subManagerDescriptiveName? string Output only. The descriptive name of the sub manager.
---@field manager? boolean Output only. Whether the customer is a manager.
---@field autoTaggingEnabled? boolean Whether auto-tagging is enabled for the customer.
---@field associateManagerDescriptiveName? string Output only. The descriptive name of the associate manager.
---@field containsEuPoliticalAdvertising? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerContainsEuPoliticalAdvertisingEnum|string Output only. Returns the advertiser self-declaration status of whether this customer contains political advertising content targeted towards the European Union. You can use the Google Ads UI to update this account-level declaration, or use the API to update the self-declaration status of individual campaigns.
---@field accountStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountStatusEnum|string Output only. Account status, for example, Enabled, Paused, Removed, etc.
---@field managerDescriptiveName? string Output only. The descriptive name of the manager.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the customer. Customer resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}`
---@field locationAssetAutoMigrationDone? boolean Output only. True if feed based location has been migrated to asset based location.
---@field locationAssetAutoMigrationDoneDateTime? string Output only. Timestamp of migration from feed based location to asset base location in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format.
---@field payPerConversionEligibilityFailureReasons? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerPayPerConversionEligibilityFailureReasonsItemEnumList Output only. Reasons why the customer is not eligible to use PaymentMode.CONVERSIONS. If the list is empty, the customer is eligible. This field is read-only.
---@field remarketingSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__RemarketingSetting Output only. Remarketing setting for a customer.
---@field finalUrlSuffix? string The URL template for appending params to the final URL.
---@field accountLevel? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountLevelEnum|string Output only. The account level of the customer: Manager, Sub-manager, Associate manager, Service account.
---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the customer.
---@field trackingUrlTemplate? string The URL template for constructing a tracking URL out of parameters.
---@field subManagerId? string Output only. The customer ID of the sub manager. A 0 value indicates that the customer has no sub SA360 manager.
---@field timeZone? string Immutable. The local timezone ID of the customer.
---@field optimizationScoreWeight? number Output only. Optimization score weight of the customer. Optimization score weight can be used to compare/aggregate optimization scores across multiple non-manager customers. The aggregate optimization score of a manager is computed as the sum over all of their customers of `Customer.optimization_score * Customer.optimization_score_weight`. This field is 0 for all manager customers, and for unscored non-manager customers. This field is read-only.
---@field videoBrandSafetySuitability? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerVideoBrandSafetySuitabilityEnum|string Brand Safety setting at the account level. Allows for selecting an inventory type to show your ads on content that is the right fit for your brand. See https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/7515513.
---@field currencyCode? string Immutable. The currency in which the account operates. A subset of the currency codes from the ISO 4217 standard is supported.
---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerStatusEnum|string Output only. The status of the customer.
---@field localServicesSettings? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__LocalServicesSettings Output only. Settings for Local Services customer.
---@field engineId? string Output only. ID of the account in the external engine account.
---@field imageAssetAutoMigrationDone? boolean Output only. True if feed based image has been migrated to asset based image.
---@field descriptiveName? string Optional, non-unique descriptive name of the customer.
---@field associateManagerId? string Output only. The customer ID of the associate manager. A 0 value indicates that the customer has no SA360 associate manager.
---@field videoCustomer? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__VideoCustomer Video specific information about a Customer.
---@field doubleClickCampaignManagerSetting? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__DoubleClickCampaignManagerSetting Output only. DoubleClick Campaign Manager (DCM) setting for a manager customer.
---@field imageAssetAutoMigrationDoneDateTime? string Output only. Timestamp of migration from feed based image to asset base image in yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss format.
---@field testAccount? boolean Output only. Whether the customer is a test account.
---@field lastModifiedTime? string Output only. The datetime when this customer was last modified. The datetime is in the customer's time zone and in "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss.ssssss" format.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountLevelEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"CLIENT_ACCOUNT_FACEBOOK"|"CLIENT_ACCOUNT_GOOGLE_ADS"|"CLIENT_ACCOUNT_MICROSOFT"|"CLIENT_ACCOUNT_YAHOO_JAPAN"|"CLIENT_ACCOUNT_ENGINE_TRACK"|"MANAGER"|"SUB_MANAGER"|"ASSOCIATE_MANAGER"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountStatusEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"ENABLED"|"PAUSED"|"SUSPENDED"|"REMOVED"|"DRAFT"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAccountTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"BAIDU"|"ENGINE_TRACK"|"FACEBOOK"|"FACEBOOK_GATEWAY"|"GOOGLE_ADS"|"MICROSOFT"|"SEARCH_ADS_360"|"YAHOO_JAPAN"

