---A link between a customer and an asset.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAsset
---@field primaryStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAssetPrimaryStatusEnum|string Output only. Provides the PrimaryStatus of this asset link. Primary status is meant essentially to differentiate between the plain "status" field, which has advertiser set values of enabled, paused, or removed. The primary status takes into account other signals (for assets its mainly policy and quality approvals) to come up with a more comprehensive status to indicate its serving state.
---@field status? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAssetStatusEnum|string Status of the customer asset.
---@field asset? string Required. Immutable. The asset which is linked to the customer.
---@field primaryStatusDetails? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AssetLinkPrimaryStatusDetailsList Output only. Provides the details of the primary status and its associated reasons.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the customer asset. CustomerAsset resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/customerAssets/{asset_id}~{field_type}`
---@field fieldType? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__CustomerAssetFieldTypeEnum|string Required. Immutable. Role that the asset takes for the customer link.
