---@field keywordPlanCampaign? string The keyword plan campaign to which this ad group belongs.

---A Keyword Plan ad group keyword. Max number of keyword plan keywords per plan: 10000.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__KeywordPlanAdGroupKeyword
