---@field filterable? boolean Output only. Whether the artifact can be used in a WHERE clause in search queries.
---@field attributeResources? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList Output only. The names of all resources that are selectable with the described artifact. Fields from these resources do not segment metrics when included in search queries. This field is only set for artifacts whose category is RESOURCE.
---@field sortable? boolean Output only. Whether the artifact can be used in a ORDER BY clause in search queries.
---@field typeUrl? string Output only. The URL of proto describing the artifact's data type.
---@field metrics? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList Output only. This field lists the names of all metrics that are selectable with the described artifact when it is used in the FROM clause. It is only set for artifacts whose category is RESOURCE.
---@field segments? gcp.searchads360_v23.StringList Output only. This field lists the names of all artifacts, whether a segment or another resource, that segment metrics when included in search queries and when the described artifact is used in the FROM clause. It is only set for artifacts whose category is RESOURCE.
