---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the topic.
---@field topicConstantParent? string Output only. Resource name of parent of the topic constant.
---@field resourceName? string Output only. The resource name of the topic constant. topic constant resource names have the form: `topicConstants/{topic_id}`

