---A user list. This is a list of users a customer may target. The unique key of a user list consists of the following fields: `id`. Note that the `name` must also be unique for user lists owned by a given customer, except in some cases where `access_reason` is set to `SHARED`. Violating the unique name constraint produces error: `UserListError.INVALID_NAME`.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserList
---@field closingReason? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListClosingReasonEnum|string Indicating the reason why this user list membership status is closed. It is only populated on lists that were automatically closed due to inactivity, and will be cleared once the list membership status becomes open.
---@field logicalUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LogicalUserListInfo User list that is a custom combination of user lists.
---@field integrationCode? string An ID from external system. It is used by user list sellers to correlate IDs on their systems.
---@field matchRatePercentage? number Output only. Indicates match rate for Customer Match lists. The range of this field is [0-100]. This will be null for other list types or when it's not possible to calculate the match rate. This field is read-only.
---@field id? string Output only. Id of the user list.
---@field sizeForSearch? string Output only. Estimated number of users in this user list in the google.com domain. These are the users available for targeting in Search campaigns. This value is null if the number of users has not yet been determined. This field is read-only.
---@field eligibleForSearch? boolean Indicates if this user list is eligible for Google Search Network.
---@field ruleBasedUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__RuleBasedUserListInfo User list generated by a rule.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the user list. User list resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/userLists/{user_list_id}`
---@field membershipLifeSpan? string Number of days a user's cookie stays on your list since its most recent addition to the list. This field must be between 0 and 540 inclusive. However, for CRM based userlists, this field can be set to 10000 which means no expiration. Beginning on April 7, 2025, using a value of 10000 to indicate no expiration will no longer be supported. This field is ignored for logical_user_list and rule_based_user_list types. Membership to lists of these types depends on the rules defined by the lists.
---@field sizeForDisplay? string Output only. Estimated number of users in this user list, on the Google Display Network. This value is if the number of users has not yet been determined. This field is -only.
---@field eligibleForDisplay? boolean Output only. Indicates this user list is eligible for Google Display Network. This field is read-only.
---@field crmBasedUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__CrmBasedUserListInfo User list of CRM users provided by the advertiser.
---@field accessReason? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListAccessReasonEnum|string Output only. Indicates the reason this account has been granted access to the list. The reason can be SHARED, OWNED, LICENSED or SUBSCRIBED. This field is read-only.
---@field description? string Description of this user list.
---@field similarUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__SimilarUserListInfo Output only. User list which are similar to users from another UserList. These lists are readonly and automatically created by google.
---@field lookalikeUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LookalikeUserListInfo Immutable. Lookalike User List.
---@field readOnly? boolean Output only. An option that indicates if a user may edit a list. Depends on the list ownership and list type. For example, external remarketing user lists are not editable. This field is -only.
---@field type? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListTypeEnum|string Output only. Type of this list. This field is read-only.
---@field basicUserList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__BasicUserListInfo User list targeting as a collection of conversion or remarketing actions.
---@field membershipStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListMembershipStatusEnum|string Membership status of this user list. Indicates whether a user list is open or active. Only open user lists can accumulate more users and can be targeted to.
---@field accountUserListStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListAccountUserListStatusEnum|string Indicates if this share is still enabled. When a UserList is shared with the user this field is set to ENABLED. Later the userList owner can decide to revoke the share and make it DISABLED. The default value of this field is set to ENABLED.
---@field sizeRangeForSearch? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListSizeRangeForSearchEnum|string Output only. Size range in terms of number of users of the UserList, for Search ads. This field is read-only.
---@field sizeRangeForDisplay? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListSizeRangeForDisplayEnum|string Output only. Size range in terms of number of users of the UserList, on the Google Display Network. This field is read-only.
---@field name? string Name of this user list. Unique per user list, except in some cases where a user list of the same name has `access_reason` set to `SHARED`.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListAccessReasonEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"OWNED"|"SHARED"|"LICENSED"|"SUBSCRIBED"|"AFFILIATED"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListAccountUserListStatusEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"ENABLED"|"DISABLED"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Resources__UserListClosingReasonEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"UNUSED"

