---@field fontFamily? string Optional. The font family is specified as a string, and must be one of the following: "Open Sans", "Roboto", "Roboto Slab", "Montserrat", "Poppins", "Lato", "Oswald", or "Playfair Display".
---@field accentColor? string Optional. Hex code representation of the accent brand color, for example #00ff00. accent_color is required when main_color is specified.
---@field mainColor? string Optional. Hex code representation of the main brand color, for example #00ff00. main_color is required when accent color is specified.
---@field autoPopulateBrandAssets? boolean Required. The switch to automatically populate top-performing brand assets. This field is required. If true, top-performing brand assets will be automatically populated. If false, the brand_assets field is required.
---@field finalUriDomain? string Optional. The domain of the final uri.
---@field campaign? string Required. The resource name of the campaign to enable.
---@field brandAssets? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__BrandCampaignAssets Optional. The brand assets linked to the campaign. This field is required when the value of auto_populate_brand_assets is false.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__EnableOperationList gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__EnableOperation[]

