---A set of users, defined by various characteristics, for which insights can be requested in AudienceInsightsService.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudience
---@field topicAudienceCombinations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceAttributeGroupList A combination of entity, category and user interest attributes defining the audience. The combination has a logical AND-of-ORs structure: Attributes within each InsightsAudienceAttributeGroup are combined with OR, and the combinations themselves are combined together with AND. For example, the expression (Entity OR Affinity) AND (In-Market OR Category) can be formed using two InsightsAudienceAttributeGroups with two Attributes each.
---@field subCountryLocations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LocationInfoList Sub-country geographic location attributes. If present, each of these must be contained in one of the countries in this audience. If absent, the audience is geographically to the country_locations and no further.
---@field ageRanges? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AgeRangeInfoList Age ranges for the audience. If absent, the audience represents all people over 18 that match the other attributes.
---@field userList? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__UserListInfo User list to be targeted by the audience.
---@field parentalStatus? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__ParentalStatusInfo Parental status for the audience. If absent, the audience does not restrict by parental status.
---@field lineups? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AudienceInsightsLineupList Lineups representing the YouTube content viewed by the audience.
---@field incomeRanges? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__IncomeRangeInfoList Household income percentile ranges for the audience. If absent, the audience does not restrict by household income range.
---@field countryLocations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LocationInfoList Required. The countries for the audience.
---@field gender? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__GenderInfo Gender for the audience. If absent, the audience does not restrict by gender.

---A list of AudienceInsightsAttributes.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceAttributeGroup
---@field attributes? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__AudienceInsightsAttributeList Required. A collection of audience attributes to be combined with logical OR. Attributes need not all be the same dimension. Only Knowledge Graph entities, Product & Service Categories, and Affinity and In-Market audiences are supported in this context.

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceAttributeGroupList gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceAttributeGroup[]

---A structured definition of the audience of interest for which insights are being requested in AudienceInsightsService.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceDefinition
---@field dataMonth? string Optional. The one-month range of historical data to use for insights, in the format "yyyy-mm". If unset, insights will be returned for the last thirty days of data.
---@field baselineAudience? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudience Optional. The baseline audience. The default, if unspecified, is all people in the same country as the audience of interest.
---@field audience? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudience Required. The audience of interest for which insights are being requested.

---A text description of the audience of interest for which insights are being requested in AudienceInsightsService.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceDescription
---@field marketingObjective? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceDescriptionMarketingObjectiveEnum|string Optional. An optional marketing objective which will influence the type of suggestions produced.
---@field audienceDimensions? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__AudienceInsightsDimensions Optional. An optional list of audience dimensions to return.
---@field countryLocations? gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Common__LocationInfoList Required. The countries for the audience.
---@field audienceDescription? string Required. An English language text description of an audience to get suggestions for. Maximum length is 2000 characters. For example, "Women in their 30s who love to travel".

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceDescriptionMarketingObjectiveEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN"|"AWARENESS"|"CONSIDERATION"|"RESEARCH"

---@alias gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudienceList gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__InsightsAudience[]

