---Average rate metrics. Metrics that represent monetary values are returned in USD by default, if unspecified in the request.
---@class gcp.searchads360_v23.GoogleAdsSearchads360V23Services__RateMetrics
---@field activeViewViewability? number The percentage of time when your ad appeared on an Active View enabled site (measurable impressions) and was viewable (viewable impressions).
---@field videoCompletionP25Rate? number Percentage of impressions where the viewer watched 25% of your video.
---@field averageCpm? number Average cost-per-thousand impressions (CPM).
---@field averageCpe? number The average cost-per-engagement (CPE) is defined by the total cost of all ad engagements divided by the total number of ad engagements.
---@field averageCpi? number The average cost-per-interaction (CPI) is defined by the total cost of all interactions divided by the total number of interactions.
---@field videoCompletionP100Rate? number Percentage of impressions where the viewer watched all of your video.
---@field videoCompletionP50Rate? number Percentage of impressions where the viewer watched 50% of your video.
---@field engagementRate? number How often people engage with your ad after it's shown to them. This is the number of ad expansions divided by the number of times your ad is shown.
---@field averageActiveViewCpm? number Average cost-per-thousand viewable impressions.
---@field trueviewViewRate? number Number of completed TrueView views divided by the number of impressions.
---@field interactionRate? number How often people interact with your ad after it is shown to them. This is the number of interactions divided by the number of times your ad is shown.
---@field videoCompletionP75Rate? number Percentage of impressions where the viewer watched 75% of your video.
---@field clickThroughRate? number The number of clicks your ad receives (Clicks) divided by the number of times your ad is shown (Impressions).
---@field trueviewAverageCpv? number The average TrueView cost-per-view (CPV) is defined by the total cost of all ad TrueView views divided by the number of TrueView views.
---@field averageCpc? number The average cost-per-click (CPC) is defined by the total cost of all clicks divided by the total number of clicks received.

